issues.proposed_resolution:
Do not publish any special=cfg row until its verifier special_route correction is merged. Add a catalog-wide control template to every cfg route:
(1) deny or disable built-in web search and fetch tools;
(2) disable auto-update and version checks, or manage them centrally;
(3) pin every model role (main, small/auxiliary, autocomplete, embeddings, reviewer) to the local or institutional endpoint;
(4) keep no cloud API keys in the environment or .env;
(5) verify the effective configuration (project files can override it);
(6) block egress at host or network level and verify it.
